WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.400
One film can speak to many audiences.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.250
Only the regions that observe a value need new pixels.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.300
Timing, motion, and media remain exact.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.300
Change the message. Keep the evidence.
